            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.117</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fixes phone pairing when the full setup payload is too large for a QR code by using a compact secure setup link.</li>
  <li>Adds a protected setup-payload endpoint so the iOS app can fetch the current full pairing JSON, including selected API/OAuth/Cerebras fields.</li>
  <li>Keeps Copy Setup JSON available for full manual import.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
