            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.116</h2><ul><li>Fixes Pair Phone QR regeneration so setup payloads are restored from the installed bridge config during status checks.</li><li>Makes Powerhouse warm/install runs nonblocking from the Companion UI, with status polling instead of a blind long-running request.</li><li>Keeps route startup independent from Powerhouse prewarm completion.</li></ul>
]]></description>
