            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.115</h2><ul><li>Improves OpenAI OAuth handoff between the iPhone app, Companion QR sync, and Companion Realtime Voice.</li><li>Keeps OpenAI STT and OpenAI Companion Realtime Voice LLMs OAuth-first, using API-key fallback only when the paired iPhone explicitly enables it.</li><li>Refreshes and persists Companion-side ChatGPT OAuth into the bridge configuration so the runtime can recover from stale imported credentials.</li><li>Preserves OpenAI TTS and GPT-Realtime-2 API-key behavior where those paths currently require it.</li></ul>
]]></description>
